## Composition with other classes

- Shapes apply to instances of target classes (`:mm/Memory`, `:mm/Tag`, etc.)
- Shapes can be members of named datasets (vocabulary publisher ships shapes + concept-schemes together)
- Shape violations could surface as audit findings parallel to the existing `sandbar.audit.*` invariants

